; Stage 15 W4b sibling sweep (design/stage15-stress-test/diagnostics.md
; §W4b): before the fix, a bare colon-typed union name ("U:i32") sailed past
; `emit-defunion`'s `!= NODE-SYM` check unchanged and registered the
; UnionDef under that literal, unlookupable key -- the same silent-
; registration bug as the others. Now rejected at the `defunion` line.
(defunion U:i32 (A x:i32) B)

(defn main ():i32 0)
